      <p class="mt-7 max-w-3xl text-xl leading-9 text-[#4a2d17]">Head-to-head for abandoned cart recovery: timing, channel mix, margin-safe incentives, and Shopify checkout context. Pair test AOVs: $746 and $117.</p>
