      <article class="prose-shopify mt-14 max-w-4xl">
        <p>ActiveCampaign vs AfterShip Email: scenario 1 — BNPL selected then dropped at review. At $746 AOV and 65% margin, full-price recovery contributes $484.9 vs $387.92 after a 13% code (Δ $96.98). Ladder touch 1 favors email proof; watch for discount on email one before trust proof. Email 1 ~87m, email 2 ~16h, SMS branch ~5h for opted-in only.</p>
        <p>ActiveCampaign vs AfterShip Email: scenario 2 — B2B cart below MOQ threshold. At $746 AOV and 65% margin, full-price recovery contributes $484.9 vs $387.92 after a 13% code (Δ $96.98). Ladder touch 2 favors SMS urgency; watch for SMS after 9pm local without quiet hours. Email 1 ~87m, email 2 ~16h, SMS branch ~5h for opted-in only.</p>
        <p>ActiveCampaign vs AfterShip Email: scenario 3 — logged-in repeat buyer with saved address. At $746 AOV and 65% margin, full-price recovery contributes $484.9 vs $387.92 after a 13% code (Δ $96.98). Ladder touch 3 favors push nudge; watch for no suppression after partial refund. Email 1 ~87m, email 2 ~16h, SMS branch ~5h for opted-in only.</p>
        <p>ActiveCampaign vs AfterShip Email: scenario 4 — international shipping quote sticker shock. At $746 AOV and 65% margin, full-price recovery contributes $484.9 vs $387.92 after a 13% code (Δ $96.98). Ladder touch 4 favors no-discount assist; watch for attribution credit on would-have-returned orders. Email 1 ~87m, email 2 ~16h, SMS branch ~5h for opted-in only.</p>
